          "text": "Bena Ashe kabakihata bantu ba mu Ako, anyi bantu ba mu Sidona, anyi ba mu Alabâ, anyi ba mu Akiziba, anyi ba mu Heleba, anyi ba mu Lehoba; ",
          "type": "text",
